  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375 degrees.",
    "Chop the cauliflower, carrots, zucchini, and onion into small pieces.",
    "Saute the chopped vegetables in olive oil until they are tender.",
    "Add the bhuna sauce, salt, and pepper to the vegetables and stir well.",
    "Warm the tortillas by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20 seconds.",
    "Assemble the kibbeh by spooning the vegetable mixture onto a tortilla and wrapping it in a lotus leaf.",
    "Place the kibbeh on a baking sheet and bake for 15 minutes.",
    "Serve the kibbeh hot and enjoy.",
    "Garnish with garlic cloves and serve immediately."
